# anthropic_federation_issuers (Data Source)

Lists OIDC issuers registered for Workload Identity Federation in the organization (beta). All pages are fetched automatically. Archived issuers are excluded unless `include_archived` is set to `true`.

> **API**: `GET /v1/organizations/federation_issuers` (beta).
> **Auth**: org:admin OAuth bearer token (`auth_token` / `ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN`). Admin API keys are not accepted.
> **Beta header**: None.
> **Cost**: Free.

